  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 3.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Hello, sorry about the delay, do sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.92,
      "end_seconds": 9.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Well, morning, doctor, sorry about the rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.78,
      "end_seconds": 11.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Right, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.05,
      "end_seconds": 32.85,
      "duration_seconds": 16.8,
      "text": "Honestly, it's weakness in the legs, and my family pushed me to come. I just want to get back to normal, really. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.11,
      "end_seconds": 36.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.16,
      "end_seconds": 48.2,
      "duration_seconds": 11.04,
      "text": "hm it was either the end of last month or earlier than that that i couldn't tell you the date"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.58,
      "end_seconds": 52.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.33,
      "end_seconds": 54.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.73,
      "end_seconds": 58.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 59.26,
      "end_seconds": 77.04,
      "duration_seconds": 17.78,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get severe back pain as well. The, The severe back pain? That's been for about a month. Oh, as for severe back pain, I'd give it a six, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.05,
      "end_seconds": 97.61,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "Let me check a a few things. Any recent fall, chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.14,
      "end_seconds": 101.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.44,
      "end_seconds": 105.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.95,
      "end_seconds": 106.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.43,
      "end_seconds": 111.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.16,
      "end_seconds": 114.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.73,
      "end_seconds": 117.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.69,
      "end_seconds": 127.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "just part of my thyroid removed, years back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.43,
      "end_seconds": 131.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.5,
      "end_seconds": 135.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "My mother had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.65,
      "end_seconds": 141.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.94,
      "end_seconds": 143.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "not really, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.03,
      "end_seconds": 159.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.81,
      "end_seconds": 164.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.8,
      "end_seconds": 167.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.01,
      "end_seconds": 173.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.36,
      "end_seconds": 181.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.53,
      "end_seconds": 185.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.67,
      "end_seconds": 188.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.65,
      "end_seconds": 191.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Injecting drugs, recent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.86,
      "end_seconds": 206.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.47,
      "end_seconds": 221.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "that's it, just a little longer.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.98,
      "end_seconds": 247.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 39.0, saturation 98 percent, pulse 89. And BP is 111 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.51,
      "end_seconds": 249.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.14,
      "end_seconds": 253.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.78,
      "end_seconds": 258.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.82,
      "end_seconds": 260.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.17,
      "end_seconds": 263.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.67,
      "end_seconds": 286.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Your spine is extremely tender at one level and your leg strength is reduced."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.57,
      "end_seconds": 302.42,
      "duration_seconds": 12.85,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. So where does that leave us? I think we're dealing with a possible spinal infection pressing on the nerves at this stage. We shouldn't forget a slipped disc."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.02,
      "end_seconds": 305.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.42,
      "end_seconds": 330.68,
      "duration_seconds": 20.26,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a possible spinal infection pressing on the nerves, and we'll know more once the urgent blood tests is back. I'm sending you for urgent blood tests because of possible spinal infection"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.9,
      "end_seconds": 333.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "that's fine with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.56,
      "end_seconds": 350.43,
      "duration_seconds": 15.87,
      "text": "let's get an urgent MRI of the spine, for possible epidural abscess. You are going to hospital now, this can cause permanent weakness. Please come and see me straight away. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.76,
      "end_seconds": 355.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.62,
      "end_seconds": 357.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}